WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
3 + 4 = ☐ + 5

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.770
What goes in the blank?

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.870
Many people write 7.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:13.310
But = means both sides balance.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.290
3 + 4 is 7.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:21.013
So the other side needs 7 too: 2 + 5.
